<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Magna Group price target up.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Magna Group price target up.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Monday it raised its intermediate six-month price target on Magna Group Inc to $31 from $27. Its long-term price target remains at $34 per share.</p>
<p>--Its EPS estimates are unchanged at $2.15 for FY96 and $2.30 for FY97.</p>
<p>--Magna Group, a regional banking company, was unchanged in mid-day trading at 27-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
